    "steps": [
        {
            "step_number": 1,
            "title": "Disassembling Weather Box Oregon BAR800",
            "text": "Weather Box, front side",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/BW2OD4EP1tLTdQes.medium",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/56997",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 2,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Rear side",
            "image": "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/mVaqBt5U6IttE2YU.medium",
            "image_links": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/mVaqBt5U6IttE2YU.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/g1x1BUOgLbFsrRSh.200x150",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/Vm62G111EIZXwyhr.200x150"
            ],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/56998",
            "comment_links": [],
            "additional_images": [
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/g1x1BUOgLbFsrRSh.medium",
                "https://guide-images.cdn.ifixit.com/igi/Vm62G111EIZXwyhr.medium"
            ]
        },
        {
            "step_number": 3,
            "title": "",
            "text": "External front side is a a plastic screen glued to the equipment. To disassembly it, insert a knife to cut the glue. It is soft glue, silicone, probably.\nBe carefull to not damage external plastic with knife",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/56999",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 4,
            "title": "",
            "text": "After plastic screen removed, it can see the screws.\nWith a small screw driver, take them off. There are eight screws.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/57000",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 5,
            "title": "",
            "text": "After screws removed, it is posible disassembly equipment by inserting a flat screw in the sides. It is strong enough to resist some efforts. Be carefull anyway.",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/57001",
            "comment_links": []
        },
        {
            "step_number": 6,
            "title": "",
            "text": "Internal view",
            "image_links": [],
            "edit_link": "https://www.ifixit.com/Guide/edit/21083/57006",
            "comment_links": []
        }
    ],
    "conclusion": {
        "text": "To reassemble your device, follow these instructions in reverse order.",
